 "notes": [
  "Format Premiere - Tatooine: posted 4 August 2001 with no Coruscant-set cards.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed, Endor, Endor: Rebel Landing Site (Forest), Heading For The Medical Frigate, Squadron Assignments, Strike Planning, The Shield Is Down!; these count toward the 60. The list totals 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Endor' dested the Light Endor system, Endor (Light); 'Heading fo the Frigate' dested Heading For The Medical Frigate; 'Squadron Ass.' dested Squadron Assignments.",
  "Posted 'General Cal' dested General Calrissian (the draft had a second General Solo); 'Wedge, Red Leader' dested Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Epp Obi' dested Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'Jedi Luke' dested Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight; 'Colonel Crackhead' dested Colonel Cracken; 'Qui-Gon' dested Qui-Gon Jinn.",
  "Posted 'DODN WA' dested Do, Or Do Not & •Wise Advice; 'Houijix Combo' dested Houjix & Out Of Nowhere; 'Barrier' dested Rebel Barrier; 'YISYW' dested Your Insight Serves You Well.",
  "Posted 'Qui-Gon's Saber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (the Reflections III Qui-Gon's Lightsaber postdates the post); 'Ani's Saber' dested Anakin's Lightsaber; 'X-Wing Cannons' dested X-wing Laser Cannon; 'Weapon Levitation' is the Light Jabba's Palace printing.",
  "Posted 'Deactivate the Main Sheild Generator' dested the Epic Event Deactivate The Shield Generator.",
